                                    <div class="col-md-6 text-column2">
                <p><span class="bw-md">As co-CEO, Guy shares joint accountability with John Stewart in setting and executing our business, performance and growth strategies.</span></p>
<p>Previously Global Head of Optimisation Services at CME Group, CEO of TriOptima and CEO of the Reset business, Guy has also held the position of Head of Asia Pacific for NEX Group’s Post-trade and Optimisation businesses and was based in Singapore. Guy spent the first half of his career as a trader in the interest rate derivatives market at Chase Manhattan Bank. Guy has an MBA from Imperial College London.</p>
