                <p><span class="bw-md">As co-CEO, John shares joint accountability with Guy Rowcliffe in designing and delivering our business, performance and growth strategies.</span></p>
<p>Formerly Partner and Senior Vice President at IHS Markit, John was CEO and Head of the MarkitServ business, responsible for product development, commercial strategy and partnerships to advance MarkitServ’s leadership position in the OTC Derivatives Markets. Previously he held multiple positions in institutional and investment banking, including Global Head of Investment Banking Operations, Chief Data Officer, UK Group COO and Head of Transformation at UBS. Earlier in his career, John worked at J.P.Morgan, in London and New York, for over 10 years in operations and technology roles in Derivatives and Securities businesses. John is a Chartered Accountant and has a Master’s in History from Oxford.</p>
