                                    <div class="col-md-6 text-column2">
                <p><span class="bw-md">As Chief Revenue Officer, James steers the company’s commercial growth by building deep strategic partnerships with our global clients to deliver long-term value and shared success.<br />
</span></p>
<p>Prior to this role, James was Head of Global Client Services and Customer Engagement for the Platforms and Regulatory Compliance division of IHS Markit. For over 10 years he has focused on Credit and Equity Derivatives whilst managing the Business Development for MarkitServ – and brings with him almost 30 years&#8217; experience in the OTC Derivatives marketplace. James has also held the positions of Vice President of Product Development at the Depository Trust and Clearing Corporation and Senior Vice President at Citibank, focused on OTC Derivative Operations across settlements, confirmations and collateral management. A graduate of Baruch College Zicklin School of Business and Business Management major, James began his career at JPMorgan Chase Bank, working in various functions in OTC Derivatives.</p>
            </div>
