                <p><span class="bw-md">As Chief Commercial Officer, Nathan focuses on the commercial strategy of OSTTRA, in partnership with our clients and sales and product functions.<br />
</span></p>
<p>Prior to OSTTRA, Nathan was founder and entity CEO of London Stock Exchange Group (LSEG) operating subsidiaries SwapAgent Ltd and LSEG Post Trade Services Ltd. Prior to SwapAgent, Nathan was Global Head of Products &amp; Markets for LCH SwapClear, Head of Solutions Products for Markit (now S&amp;P) and Global Head of Sales &amp; Marketing for Cantor Fitzgerald’s Information Services business (now BGC’s Fenics Market Data). Nathan holds a BA in International Studies from American University.</p>
