<p>Ajay has a track record of delivering both substantial growth and increases in enterprise value. He has held leadership roles in the public and private sectors in the United States, across a range of industries &#8211; including telecoms, renewable fuels, and management consulting. Prior to joining OSTTRA, Ajay was most recently CFO of FTI Consulting, a global business consulting firm, and before that, Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of FairPoint Communications, Inc., a leading provider of telecommunications services.</p>
<p>Before he was a CFO, Ajay worked as a telecommunications equity analyst for Canadian banks. He has an MBA from Manchester Business School, UK, an MS (Honors) in Economics from Birla Institute of Technology &amp; Science, India, and a BE (Honors) in Mechanical Engineering, also from Birla Institute of Technology &amp; Science.</p>
